{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "013kys_401_2_4_013_01_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a91cc3ea120a66ce6e00fe6ca2236140fe8ac272085033e620ffc2bdfc8f262b",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:013kys_401_2_4_013_01_09_a:2_4_013_01_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5445e3b7de93bbd91e1b431023df953a5ec93155aaceacefe597d1dee104ef6e",
      "text": "喂喂，●●●●●●●●●●监督！\n今天工作也辛苦啦～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_401_2_4_013_01_09_a:2_4_013_01_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc884a722018bf5f58595d8ae2937f6b788497225d7c449bdf5660010525a456",
      "text": "我在读下一份工作的剧本。\n不是被要求加点即兴发挥吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_401_2_4_013_01_09_a:2_4_013_01_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bbdf12b29fb852d8c773fa8ca6f8a4588310f65eb71f212cbd8ae207794af9ab",
      "text": "正在琢磨要怎么设计呢，就想起了圣诞节\n节目的事，忍不住想打个电话了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_401_2_4_013_01_09_a:2_4_013_01_09_a:cmd-000012:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6482718bafa8f60d727d675bee03b1a921177a70bc1b1ee9e3a62442f1c8a4ab",
      "text": "那是一份令人印象深刻\n的工作呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_401_2_4_013_01_09_a:2_4_013_01_09_a:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ce487f80e61d1d65b704f3fc8d739560d581bcb6618ac2a26d830b6a66eb26e",
      "text": "对吧，我也这么觉得。\n虽然那次和即兴发挥稍微有点不同……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_401_2_4_013_01_09_a:2_4_013_01_09_a:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d02dbba08c9677dcab842e59acc92d692b7c42a6b2dd1185c4283974a70c518",
      "text": "但那是个情境设定也能展现我的风格的、\n特别的工作啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_401_2_4_013_01_09_a:2_4_013_01_09_a:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15caa821d14d8619a795433ec8ef1dff2847225e1837194726ea0d116e67d8bd",
      "text": "因为是和足球相关的场地，思考演出安排\n超级开心的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_401_2_4_013_01_09_a:2_4_013_01_09_a:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf860f64d16ab26e6c6b110682d6a2f1fa1ccea8f3482514687112194f782167",
      "text": "而且演起来也很沉着平稳。\n要是换个地方，大概又会不一样了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_401_2_4_013_01_09_a:2_4_013_01_09_a:cmd-000023:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ac2a0b7e130f8aed81e29b5e8ce7aa611cd0952134797467a14bcd8dd8a5a25",
      "text": "享介先生的话在别的地方\n也没问题的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_401_2_4_013_01_09_a:2_4_013_01_09_a:cmd-000024:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3433c3026b49b550b423ef5e116e04bae9aee672e952e9f146bd98f12b1a4358",
      "text": "一定也能\n表现得很好的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_401_2_4_013_01_09_a:2_4_013_01_09_a:cmd-000027:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e14efe95abede61e93c85aed02c57af5df5f4ce91b300973e7e9591584790b6b",
      "text": "啊哈哈！谢谢。\n嗯，我也这么觉得。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_401_2_4_013_01_09_a:2_4_013_01_09_a:cmd-000029:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75c8daf8876447343e5f20abc343b92eda0a98eae5e0a4ba552cd9d5726d9afe",
      "text": "毕竟就算遇到了困难，我身边也有可以依靠的人嘛。\n监督、悠介、还有事务所的大家……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_401_2_4_013_01_09_a:2_4_013_01_09_a:cmd-000031:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6240ef8f4e27fd39ae17cf5fbbc4565020cd0b6117c31f8cafaffc88d8ae386",
      "text": "监督要是遇到了什么烦心事，\n也尽管来找我商量哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_401_2_4_013_01_09_a:2_4_013_01_09_a:cmd-000033:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2123a4085efa3e113d43eb8d80e50c9d493d734cd010a4bcf96570225797241",
      "text": "能不能帮上忙另说，说出来转换一下心情\n也是好的嘛。那就回聊！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
